  characterNameEN: Leo
  characterNameKR: "\uB808\uC624"
  sentencesEN:
  - Everyone else is weak, but you can stay by my side.
  - You're precious to me too.
  - With you, no one can stop us.
  sentencesKR:
  - "\uB2E4\uB978 \uC560\uB4E4\uC740 \uB2E4 \uC57D\uD558\uC9C0\uB9CC, \uB108\uB294
